# Vercel CLI state. `.vercel/` holds the project link, and the CLI writes
# `.env.local` there and at the root containing a VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN.
#
# The CLI appended a bare `.env*` here on first link. That is removed: it came after
# the `!.env.example` negation above and silently re-ignored the example file, which
# is committed on purpose. The rules at the top of this file already cover every
# `.env` variant.
.vercel/
